«
@@ ============================================================
@@ GPStoUTC — GPS week and time of week to UTC date and time. GPS time
@@ started on 1980-01-06 at 0h UTC and is 18 s ahead of UTC since 2017-01-01.
@@ 
@@ Input : week tow — week number without rollover, seconds in the week; a
@@         time with a unit is accepted.
@@ Output: date time — date as YYYYMMDD, UTC time as HH.MMSS.
@@ Dates before 2017 have other leap seconds, and stop with an error.
@@ ============================================================

  IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_s CONVERT UVAL END
  → wek tow
  «
    wek 604800 * tow + 18 -
    → scd
    «
      scd 86400 / FLOOR R→I
      scd 86400 MOD
      → dys rmn
      «
        IF scd 1167264000 < THEN "GPStoUTC needs a date from 2017 on" DOERR END
        19800106 dys Date+
        rmn 3600 / →HMS
      »
    »
  »
»
